<title>UK: BayerLB sets 10 bln yen two-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 10 bln yen two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     1.25	MATURITY    26.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.54    PAY DATE   S25.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    NONE	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
